            "review_text": "Gina\nLiestal, Switzerland41 contributions\n0\nVery polite staff and great menu!\nAug 2025 • Friends\nCute caffee with lots of choices and very polite staff!\nThe egg coffe was big compared to other café’s. They had various sweet bakeries and the staff helped us getting the drinks we wanted, eventough we don’t speak vietnamese, Tuan Hung and Tien Nhan helped us and we even got a free drink!\nWe will come back!\nRead more\nWritten August 15, 2025\nLucific Cafe\nThank you for your wonderful review, Gina! We're delighted you enjoyed our egg coffee, pastries, and friendly service. We'll be sure to share your kind words with Tuan Hung and Tien Nhan. We look forward to welcoming you back to Lucific Café soon! ☕\nRead more\nWritten July 20, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
